WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.619
Welcome to Orbit. People and places. Our focus is who / which / where.

2
00:00:07.619 --> 00:00:13.677
Use who for people, which for things and where for places in defining relative clauses.

3
00:00:13.677 --> 00:00:16.871
Lina is the volunteer who teaches art.

4
00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:19.770
This is the room where visitors study.

5
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.384
The centre has a garden which is open to everyone.

6
00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:32.782
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
